# The spoken half hour names the COMING hour: "pusė trijų" (half of three)
# is 02:30, "pusė aštuonių" is 07:30 -- hence bare_half_to + toward_hour_12h,
# with the hour in the genitive.  Source: en.wiktionary.org, https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/pus%C4%97
# ("half"); Talkpal, "Telling Time in Lithuanian Grammar".
pusė
